Subject: [PATCH 01/12] SDL: include <clocale> for setlocale() in the SDL2_ttf
 text drawer

It was only declared through other headers on glibc; FreeBSD-based libcs
(such as the PS4's) need the include.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P3uAWaEfvY2JvhAv7RuSyc
---
 Common/Render/Text/draw_text_sdl.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Common/Render/Text/draw_text_sdl.cpp b/Common/Render/Text/draw_text_sdl.cpp
index dbec9cb..6fd9e25 100644
--- a/Common/Render/Text/draw_text_sdl.cpp
+++ b/Common/Render/Text/draw_text_sdl.cpp
@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@
 
 #if defined(USE_SDL2_TTF)
 
+#include <clocale>
+
 #include "SDL2/SDL.h"
 #include "SDL2/SDL_ttf.h"
 
